mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\n\\land I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot{\\in})\n=\\{a\\in M^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\n\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall s\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ctm}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal L\\;\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L,\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ctm}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal L\\;\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L,\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Symbol\">[Symbol]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>CTM</code>: Countable transitive model</li>\n<li><code>CTMInLanguage</code>: Countable transitive membership model in an explicit language</li>\n<li><code>TransitiveSet</code>: Transitive set</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Symbol","text":"[Symbol]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[